Among the individual interviewees (@tbl-deforestation_individual), a majority of interviewees also indicated that CFM had reduced deforestation inside the CFA. The differences among the interviewee roles were not significant (@tbl-M2_deforestation_individual). However, there was a significant effect of gender. Male interviewees were significantly more likely to state that CFM had reduced deforestation (@tbl-M2_deforestation_individual).


